          {
            "title": "Example: Return",
            "id": 127133,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kembalikan nilai dari fungsi ini.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"func\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"giveMeTen\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" -&gt; \" /><text value=\"Int\" class=\"type\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(giveMeTen())\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"23\" /><option startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"33\" /><option startIndex=\"34\" endIndex=\"36\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"String\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"10\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>Int</code>, diikuti oleh <code>return</code>, dan terakhir <code>10</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Any type",
            "id": 127134,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kembalikan string dengan menulis kode <code>greeting</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"func\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"addGreeting\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(user: String)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" -&gt; \" /><text value=\"String\" class=\"type\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" greeting = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Greetings &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + user\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" greeting\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = addGreeting(user: \" /><text value=\"&quot;Saoirse&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(result)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"87\" endIndex=\"95\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Greetings Saoirse\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu mengetik <code>greeting</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Return",
            "id": 127135,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kembalikan satu nilai dari fungsi ini.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"func\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"lessThanFive\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(number: Int)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" -&gt; \" /><text value=\"Bool\" class=\"type\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" lessThan = number &lt; \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" lessThan\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = lessThanFive(number: \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(result)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"69\" endIndex=\"75\" /><option startIndex=\"76\" endIndex=\"84\" /><option startIndex=\"34\" endIndex=\"38\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"Int\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>Bool</code>, diikuti oleh <code>return</code>, dan terakhir <code>lessThan</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Using the return value",
            "id": 127136,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Panggil fungsi <code>addTen()</code> dengan sebuah nilai.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"func\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"addTen\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(number: Int)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" -&gt; \" /><text value=\"Int\" class=\"type\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" addedTen = \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" + number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" addedTen\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(addTen(number: \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"))\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"88\" endIndex=\"94\" /><option startIndex=\"94\" endIndex=\"95\" /><option startIndex=\"95\" endIndex=\"102\" /><option startIndex=\"103\" endIndex=\"105\" /><option startIndex=\"105\" endIndex=\"106\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"30\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>addTen</code>, diikuti oleh <code>(</code>, lalu <code>number:</code>, <code>20</code>, <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
